<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Tech Data raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Tech Data raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Soundview Financial said it raised the short-term rating on Tech Data Corp to buy from hold, and raised the earnings estimate to $1.61 from $1.54 for 1998, ending in January.</p>
<p>-- shares gained 1-1/8 to 27-7/8.</p>
</text>
